Thanks @Tristina1788 - those are valid observations.  I look forward to @lilitkarapetyan fixing them.

@lilitkarapetyan - I have another issue too, please.  In the game, the editor control shows the SIDC expressed as letters.  When I click on `Edit` - the popup does not show the right values for that symbol.   I can choose some values, then when I Save it, the numeric SIDC is shown.  If I switch to another feature, then back, it shows the numeric SIDC.  If I open the editor for that symbol, then it does show the correct attributes for that shape.

So, I _think_ the editor needs to check for a text SIDC.  If one is provided, it should convert it to numeric, and the popup should show the correct existing fields for the symbol.

@lilitkarapetyan Now the new shape item get Sidc code is text. should we use number code as last changes? 


